          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nih gidaghadooweeda jea ghoadayda Haruni sea orjoagaaschi gil jea ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA aba damanda jea eamwaara: gideaba damanamughuush bea dearanga miyas was dearanga miyaasiin ghoah haleanjeeda gealaan bea ghadooweeda gidagween iyeenya sakteayda ea dea agweena iyeenya shing'ada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gasin aba nagheeda aba jeeda dahuuda bwarak; ak giiguuyi muuchi, ak gisini nea giimaneanyayi gawuurji dearanga ghadooweeda, ak giidaydi ghoah shearooda ng'andit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ashoohoocheanjagi aba jeeda orjooga Haruni, ghayi simwaar jea gwahearan niny, gayghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA ghoah diigheanda damanda manda muudeanooda; nea gida heeda haw gajeaghwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo ea dearanga ghadooweeda bea ashoohoocheanda gajeaghwarda sean; ak ea majeayaak.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
