        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda jea eayaak was dea siyeadu foojeanda wassean jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa ak gwasin giiduupcheeda aba heeda ghaydit; gajeaghwarda aba beasta.",
